      "---",
      "",
      "## Day 18：反范式化 — 什么时候该违反范式",
      "",
      "范式化不是绝对的。在实际项目中，**性能比理论上的纯洁更重要**。",
      "",
      "### 常见的反范式场景",
      "",
      "#### 1. 缓存统计值",
      "",
      "```sql",
      "-- 范式做法：每次需要时 COUNT",
      "SELECT COUNT(*) FROM orders WHERE user_id = 123;",
      "",
      "-- 反范式做法：在 users 表加一个 order_count 列",
      "ALTER TABLE users ADD COLUMN order_count INTEGER DEFAULT 0;",
      "-- 下单时 UPDATE users SET order_count = order_count + 1 ...",
      "```",
      "",
      "适用场景：频繁读取的统计值（如用户主页显示的「订单数」「粉丝数」）。",
      "",
      "#### 2. 历史快照",
      "",
      "`order_items.unit_price` 存的是**成交时的价格**，而不是 JOIN products 表查当前价格。",
      "",
      "为什么？因为商品价格今天 299，明天可能调到 199——但历史订单应该反映的是当时的成交价。",
      "",
      "#### 3. 报表宽表",
      "",
      "为了查询速度，提前计算好聚合结果存在一张大宽表里——**ETL 的典型做法**。",
      "",
      "**核心原则**：读多写少 → 反范式；写多读少 → 范式。"
    ]
  },
  {
    "cell_id": "cell-14",
    "cell_type": "code",
    "source": [
      "# Day 18 练习：用触发器维护反范式化的冗余列",
      "",
      "# 在 bookstore.books 表增加 sales_count 列",
      "!docker exec pg-learn psql -U postgres -d learn -c \"",
      "ALTER TABLE bookstore.books ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS sales_count INTEGER DEFAULT 0;",
      "\"",
      "",
      "# 创建函数和触发器：插入销售时自动更新 sales_count",
      "!docker exec pg-learn psql -U postgres -d learn -c \"",
      "CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION bookstore.update_book_sales_count()",
      "RETURNS TRIGGER AS $$",
      "BEGIN",
      "    UPDATE bookstore.books",
      "    SET sales_count = COALESCE(sales_count, 0) + NEW.quantity",
      "    WHERE id = NEW.book_id;",
      "    RETURN NEW;",
      "END;",
      "$$ LANGUAGE plpgsql;",
      "\"",
      "",
      "!docker exec pg-learn psql -U postgres -d learn -c \"",
      "DROP TRIGGER IF EXISTS trg_update_sales_count ON bookstore.sales;",
      "CREATE TRIGGER trg_update_sales_count",
      "AFTER INSERT ON bookstore.sales",
      "FOR EACH ROW",
      "EXECUTE FUNCTION bookstore.update_book_sales_count();",
      "\"",
      "",
      "# 验证：先看当前 sales_count",
      "!docker exec pg-learn psql -U postgres -d learn -c \"",
      "SELECT id, title, sales_count FROM bookstore.books ORDER BY id LIMIT 5;",
      "\"",
      "",
      "print(\"\\n现在插入一条新销售记录，看 sales_count 会不会自动更新...\")"
    ]
  },
  {
    "cell_id": "cell-15",
    "cell_type": "code",
    "source": [
      "# 插入新销售记录",
      "!docker exec pg-learn psql -U postgres -d learn -c \"",
      "INSERT INTO bookstore.sales (book_id, customer_id, quantity, sale_date)",
      "VALUES (1, 1, 2, NOW());",
      "\"",
      "",
      "# 查看是否自动更新",
      "!docker exec pg-learn psql -U postgres -d learn -c \"",
      "SELECT id, title, sales_count FROM bookstore.books WHERE id = 1;",
      "\"",
      "",
